# Forum backup schedule (issue #48) — consumed by the agentbox
# [program:forum-backup-cron] supercronic service. Editable live: supercronic
# re-reads this file from the workspace mount; no image rebuild needed.
# 03:10 UTC nightly — after the CF Workers' own quiet period, before the 04:00
# dream-cycle window.
# timeout (coreutils, on the program's pinned PATH) bounds the night at 2 h and
# kills 60 s after TERM; overlap is prevented inside the script with an atomic
# mkdir lock, because flock(1) (util-linux) is NOT on that pinned PATH and a
# `flock` here would make every night fail with "command not found".
10 3 * * * timeout -k 60 7200 /home/devuser/workspace/dreamlab-ai-website/scripts/backup/forum-backup.sh
